00:04:47.375 --> 00:04:49.577
Below the vibrator is a screen.

00:04:49.577 --> 00:04:50.545
This means that

00:04:50.545 --> 00:04:52.513
after the raw materials arrive in Taiwan,

00:04:52.513 --> 00:04:54.048
the first batch is processed by vibration,

00:04:54.048 --> 00:04:55.416
which shakes away

00:04:55.416 --> 00:04:56.584
