00:16:17.481 --> 00:16:19.983
Because we usually eat standard products

00:16:19.983 --> 00:16:22.753
that have undergone rigorous selection

00:16:22.753 --> 00:16:25.556
by R&amp;D, quality assurance, and production lines

00:16:25.556 --> 00:16:28.659
to determine the true quality.

00:16:28.659 --> 00:16:30.894
Remembering the taste after eating

00:16:30.894 --> 00:16:32.029
it is difficult. If there's a problem

